trong>“軽さ”</strong>の視点で整理し</p><p>選びやすいチャートにまとめました。</p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px;">まずは<strong>『暖かさ順』</strong>でご紹介します。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px;">寒い季節の強い味方になるラインナップが勢ぞろい。</span></p></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1764225889607" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1764225889607" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/9ae097a1-a44f-4887-b7a4-1122a752e622/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/%E6%96%B0%E4%BD%9C%E7%99%BA%E5%A3%B2%E6%B1%BA%E5%AE%9A%20_28_.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="80%" data-height="auto" title="" width="1040" height="1040" natural-width="1040" natural-height="1040"></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1764754670593" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1764754670593"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>いつもの暮らしから旅行、仕事まで<br>シーンに合わせて</p><p>“ちょうどいい一枚”がきっと見つかります。</p><p><br></p></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1764294664886" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1764294664886"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1764294664884" data-id="1764294664884"><div data-label="Separator" data-key="separator" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1764297011871" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-separator" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1764297011871"><div class="elm gf-elm-center" data-align="left"><hr class="gf_separator"></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1764309634182" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1764309634182"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1764309634225" data-id="1764309634225"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1764314513107" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1764314513107"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">足元まですっぽり包み込む</h1><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">「あったかコート」</h1></div></div><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1764309641863" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1764309641863" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><a href="https://kapok-knot.com/products/reversible_boa_quiltingcoat" target=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/7c6b0b8d-f958-48c2-a51c-b752c4a8e9c9/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/2.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="100%" data-height="auto" title="" width="1000" height="1500" natural-width="1000" natural-height="1500"></a></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1764309653980" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1764309653980"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">リバーシブルボアキルティングコート</h1></div></div><div data-label="Button" data-key="button" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1764309662724" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-gpicon-button" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1764309662724"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-stretch-lg="0"><a class="button btn gf_button gf_gs-button-element gf_gs-button---large" href="https://kapok-knot.com/products/reversible_boa_quiltingcoat" target="" data-scroll-speed="2000" data-exc=""><span>詳しく見る</span></a></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1764309720933" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1764309720933"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><strong>【選ばれるポイント3つ】</strong></p><p><b>・“ボア×キルティング”を気分で</b><b style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px;">使い分けられる2WAYリバーシブル</b></p><p><b>・足元まで暖かいロング丈で冷たい風をしっかりブロック</b></p><p><b>・寒がりさんでも安心のあたたかさを叶える保温設計</b></p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1764309880800" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1764309880800"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>寒さが深まる12月、</p><p>後悔しないために備えたい“しっかり暖かい”コート<span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px;">。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px;"><br></span></p><p>ふんわり包むボア面と、</p><p>すっきり見えるキルティング面を</p><p>気分で選べるリバーシブル仕様です。</p><p><br></p><p>ロング丈が足元の冷気を遮り</p><p>首まわりまであたたかい設計で冬のお出かけを快適に。<br>厚手ニットを着てももたつかず、真冬日でも活躍します。</p><p><br></p><p>今の気温から2〜3月の寒波シーズンまで</p><p>頼れる一着だからこそ、気温が下がりきる前の</p><p>“今”がいちばんの買い時です。</p><p><br></p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1764309764471" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1764309764471"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><strong>足元まで、ぬくもりに包まれるコート</strong></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1764296891827" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1764296891827" data-layout-lg="3+3+3+3" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="3+3+3+3" data-layout-sm="6+6+6+6" data-layout-xs="6+6+6+6"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-3 gf_col-md-3 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-6" id="c-1764225713576" data-id="1764225713576"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1764296891674" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1764296891674" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><a href="https://kapok-knot.com/products/%E3%82%AA%E3%83%BC%E3%83%90%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B5%E3%82%A4%E3%82%BA%E3%83%A9%E3%82%B0%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3" target=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/8ee8c39d-037d-4310-8233-1e3cbb9d5e14/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/%E3%82%B5%E3%83%A0%E3%83%8D10%20_3_.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" width="1000" height="1500" data-width="100%" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="1000" natural-height="1500"></a></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1764910491605" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1764910491605" style="display: block;"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>オーバーサイズラグランコート</p></div></div><div data-label="Button" data-key="button" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1764296891723" class="element-wrap