挨拶回りや出張が増える時期にも対応できる</p><p>汎用性の高さから、“今”揃えるべき一着として選ばれています。</p><p><br></p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1764309968810" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1764309968810"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><strong>仕事の顔を、上品に整えるコート</strong></p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1764225713635" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1764225713635" data-layout-lg="3+3+3+3" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="3+3+3+3" data-layout-sm="6+6+6+6" data-layout-xs="6+6+6+6"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-3 gf_col-md-3 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-6" id="c-1764225713576" data-id="1764225713576"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1764225791720" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1764225791720" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><a href="https://kapok-knot.com/products/men-balmacaan-coat-22" target=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/7f8a30de-a6f4-4a53-a99b-159a154b2752/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/6.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" width="1000" height="1500" data-width="100%" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="1000" natural-height="1500"></a></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1764910788179" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1764910788179" style="display: block;"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>バルマカンコート</p></div></div><div data-label="Button